AmbireRecoveryActionIsAuthorizedTest
├── when the kit slot holds this action's binding
│   └── it should return true
├── when the kit slot is empty
│   └── it should return false
├── when the kit slot holds a key value
│   └── it should return false
├── when the kit slot holds another action's binding
│   └── it should return false
├── when the binding sits under another address
│   └── it should return false
├── when the kit slot holds any other value
│   └── it should return false
├── when two actions share one account
│   └── it should read each action's own slot
├── when the account has no code
│   └── it should revert
└── when the account returns nothing
    └── it should revert
